Dark Throne was added in '''Beta 39.0''' sharing the same [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Epic Epic] Rarity and 5G 4/4 stats as [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Throne Throne], as well as a Magic effect that lets you draw a specific card. While Throne stayed the same, '''Beta 47.0''' gave Dark Throne +1 HP (until Beta 49.0, where Throne also gained +1 HP).

=== Stats ===
ATK: 4

HP:
* 4 (Post Beta 39.0)
* 5 (Post Beta 47.0, Current)
Cost: 5

Ability: Magic: Draw a card that didn't start in your deck.

Rarity: Purple (Epic)
